# Fleet / e2e run artifacts. Timings and per-run ids from a live workspace —
# useful locally, not worth versioning, and one careless `git add .` away from
# committing whatever a future run decides to record.
.e2e/

# Code-map fixture corpus: vendored dirs, build output and .env files are deliberate decoys and
# canary placeholders (docs/codemap/FIXTURES.md), so they are committed on purpose.
!test/fixtures/codemap/**/node_modules/
!test/fixtures/codemap/**/dist/
!test/fixtures/codemap/**/.env
!test/fixtures/codemap/**/.env.local
# Local scan cache and offline queue (never committed).
.swfte/codemap/
